    "Each code once. Empty rows are ignored." : {

    },
    "Each unpaid bill gets a reminder in the owner's To pay list in Reminders, with the due date; completing it marks the bill paid. The reminder shows only the sender and reference, not the amount or IBAN. Off: bills are only in To Pay here; reminders that already exist keep working. Applies to all your devices." : {

    },
    "Earlier bills from %@ used %@. Check that this address belongs to %@ or their payment provider before paying." : {

    },
    "Earlier bills from %@ were paid to %@. Fraudsters often send a familiar-looking invoice with only the IBAN changed. Before paying, check the new account with %@ using a phone number or website you already know, not the details on this invoice." : {

